    "summary": "Errata rewriting [Enraged Behemoths](vsdata:ability/tyranids.crusher-stampede.enraged-behemoths). Each attack by a **TYRANIDS MONSTER** model of yours gets:\n\n- +1 to its **[Hit roll](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)** if the model's unit is under its **Starting Strength**\n- also +1 to its **[Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)** if it is **Below Half-strength**\n\nWhile one of your **TYRANIDS MONSTER** units is not **Battle-shocked** and still at Starting Strength, its models get +2 Objective Control.",
